  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inspire Academy: Empowering Tomorrow&apos;s Leader</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The pilot project aims to empower Moroccan youth aged 18&#xfffd;30 by strengthening their civic engagement, leadership skills, and knowledge of youth rights. Participants will take part in three weekend seminars held in different cities, along with a series of webinars focusing on advocacy, project management, and democratic participation. They will have the opportunity to apply for small-scale grants through a project pool to implement their own local initiatives. The target group consists mainly of university students from diverse academic and geographic backgrounds, with a strong focus on gender equality and inclusion of youth from outside the major cities.</narrative>
  </description>
